pve-storage-quantastor (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * v0.2.0 — first-class PVE storage type 'quantastor' (no PVE core patching).
  * PVE::Storage::QuantaStor::APIClient: OO REST client for the QuantaStor API.
  * PVE::Storage::QuantaStor::ISCSIManager: iSCSI initiator lifecycle
    management (login/logout/discovery/rescan).
  * PVE::Storage::Custom::QuantaStor: full storage plugin covering all hooks —
    activate, status, list, alloc, free, path, online resize (flags=2),
    snapshot, rollback, clone, and template creation.
  * PVE::API2::Storage::QuantaStorScan: pool-scan API endpoint
    (GET /nodes/<node>/scan/quantastor), injected into Scan.pm by postinst.
  * Web UI dialog: storage-ID auto-fill (qs-storage-N), pool scan dropdown,
    content type locked to 'Disk image'.
  * Password stored in /etc/pve/priv/storage/<id>.pw (pmxcfs-replicated),
    never written to storage.cfg.
  * dpkg file triggers re-inject the UI script tag and scan endpoint after
    pve-manager / pve-storage upgrades.
  * Validated on PVE 9.1.x and 9.2.x, including two-node cluster live
    migration. Loads on both (api=13).

